#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore quantum approaches to matrix diagonalization, including VQE, QKD, SKD and variations of these."
msgstr "Terokai pendekatan kuantum untuk pepenjuruan matriks, termasuk VQE, QKD, SKD dan variasi daripadanya."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Imej hero\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course provides an overview of several approaches to quantum diagonalization. Some background is provided on the classical methods that are used, or that motivated the quantum algorithms. The content then steps through the implementation of the quantum algorithms on real quantum computers. There is substantial discussion of what factors determine the scaling of approaches using classical and quantum algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini memberikan gambaran keseluruhan beberapa pendekatan untuk penepatan kuantum. Latar belakang kaedah klasik yang digunakan, atau yang mendorong algoritma kuantum, turut disertakan. Kandungan kemudian membimbing anda melalui pelaksanaan algoritma kuantum pada komputer kuantum sebenar. Terdapat perbincangan menyeluruh tentang faktor-faktor yang menentukan skala pendekatan menggunakan algoritma klasik dan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disyorkan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with quantum computing and want to leverage its power in matrix diagonalization.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini ditujukan kepada individu yang mempunyai sedikit pengalaman dengan pengkomputeran kuantum dan ingin memanfaatkan kuasanya dalam penepatan matriks.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend that learners complete the following prerequisites prior to this course:\n"
msgstr "Kami mengesyorkan pelajar melengkapkan prasyarat berikut sebelum kursus ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your local environment by following along with the [Get started](/guides/) guide in our documentation page.\n"
msgstr "Sediakan persekitaran tempatan anda dengan mengikuti panduan [Mulakan](/guides/) dalam laman dokumentasi kami.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For deeper understanding of quantum information, try [Basics of Quantum Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) with John Watrous.\n"
msgstr "Untuk pemahaman yang lebih mendalam tentang maklumat kuantum, cuba [Asas Maklumat Kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) bersama John Watrous.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Peperiksaan {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum diagonalization algorithms, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan lencana Algoritma penepatan kuantum anda, ambil peperiksaan di IBM&reg; Training. Peperiksaan ini bertujuan untuk diduduki setelah membaca pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah anda lulus peperiksaan, anda akan diberitahu oleh Credly bahawa anda telah memperoleh lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Peperiksaan](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms/exam)\n"

